  "description": "Georgia, a high school sophomore who grew up in difficult circumstances without knowing her parents. She lives a life where nothing really works out, being looked down on by those around her and having a hard time finding a common part-time job. While lamenting her life, a hellish messenger suddenly appears in front of her and offers to grant her wish in exchange for her soul. Just as she is about to sign the contract, a heavenly governor appears from the sky and it becomes a double contract?!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
